2 true] [17592186290242 1145 "We need to use integration by parts. \n\nIn this case, we define\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={x}^{2}\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =({x}^{2})(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1))-\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)(2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)-2\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we use integration by parts to evaluate $\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\text{d}x.$ We take\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the formula for integration by parts gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(x)(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1))-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1))(1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+D,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $D$ is an integral constant.\n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)-2(-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+D) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)-2D \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-2)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=-2D.$" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290244 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290245 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290246 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290247 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290248 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1041 "selection" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1104 #edb/ref 17592186290248 13194139534472 true] [17592186290243 1110 #uuid "6f675360-100a-535b-a981-36590c8d2cec" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290244 1034 "(2{x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+2{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+C" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534472 true] [17592186290244 1111 #uuid "e92c7e7f-0898-5495-8775-9f89571247a1" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290245 1034 "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+C" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290245 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534472 true] [17592186290245 1111 #uuid "eddb82aa-4fdb-5efb-ae9a-998c74423330" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290246 1034 "2({x}^{2}-1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+C" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290246 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534472 true] [17592186290246 1111 #uuid "62528880-3824-52d7-9490-8fbbb6b80665" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290247 1034 "({x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+C" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290247 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534472 true] [17592186290247 1111 #uuid "67618cd1-4594-5970-b16d-00e36b209fab" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290248 1034 "({x}^{2}-2)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+C" 13194139534472 true] [17592186290248 1103 #edb/ref 175921860454